gantt
    title Release plan
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat %b %e
    excludes weekends
    section Build
    Design          :done, des, 2024-06-03, 5d
    Implement       :active, imp, after des, 8d
    Code freeze     :milestone, frz, after imp, 0d
    section Test
    System test     :crit, tst, after imp, 5d
    Release         :rel, after tst, 2d
